@host = http://localhost:5234

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/Users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/Users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!"
}

### Get All Exams
GET {{host}}/api/Exams

### Get Exam by ID
GET {{host}}/api/Exams/1

### Get All Courses
GET {{host}}/api/Courses

### Get All Questions
GET {{host}}/api/Questions

### Get Questions by Course
GET {{host}}/api/Questions?courseId=1&difficulty=Medium
